# 文本统一：仓库内存 LF，检出时按平台还原（Windows → CRLF）
* text=auto

# 二进制资源：不做文本转换、不参与行级 diff
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.bmp  binary
*.tif  binary
*.tiff binary
*.zip  binary
*.7z   binary
*.pdf  binary
*.pyc  binary

# 常见二进制资源 diff 时按图片处理（GitHub 等平台友好）
*.png  diff=image
*.jpg  diff=image
*.jpeg diff=image
